&lt;/table&gt;&lt;p style="clear:both; line-height:0.75pt; width:100%; font-size:0.75pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class="smt_anno1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:8.5pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;"&gt;　(注)１. 2023年１月31日にＡ種種類株式をAAGS S3,L.P.に対して第三者割当にて発行したものであります。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_anno1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:36pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-27pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:14pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt; 　　　　発行価額　1,999,952千円　資本組入額　999,976千円&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_anno1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:36pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-27pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:15pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:ChangesInNumberOfIssuedSharesStatedCapitalEtcTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:ShareholdingByShareholderCategoryTextBlock contextRef="FilingDateInstant">
&lt;h4 class="smt_head3" style="padding-left:13.5pt;"&gt;(5) 【所有者別状況】&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:13.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;　　普通株式&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_unitR" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:right;padding-left:377.3pt;line-height:10pt;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;2024年３月31日&lt;/span&gt;現在&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="tbld" style="margin-left:30pt;margin-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"&gt;
&lt;table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse;border:solid 0pt #000000;width:450.8pt;table-layout:fixed;"&gt;
&lt;colgroup&gt;
&lt;col style="width:57pt;min-width:57pt;"/&gt;
&lt;col style="width:44.6pt;min-width:44.6pt;"/&gt;
&lt;col style="width:44.6pt;min-width:44.6pt;"/&gt;
&lt;col style="width:44.6pt;min-width:44.6pt;"/&gt;
